    {
      "text": "Cover photograph of three young men outdoors in a rural village setting, each looking at a small red-and-white card or packet; two sit on wooden stools and one stands carrying a wooden tool over his shoulder, with a tiled-roof wooden house and trees behind them.",
      "lang": "en",
